WEBVTT


00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.311
WEEKEND WITH MY MOTHER


00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:16.870
My best friends are the polar bears.


00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:25.913
Whenever my polar bear leans over
and hugs me...


00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.914
...all becomes quiet
and nothing matters...


00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.672
Just the peace I find in his arms...


00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.716
Cris? Cris...


00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:45.714
Damn it...


00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:03.276
Come! Say hello to aunt Luiza
and go to bed.


00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:04.549
Hello!


00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.590
This is the little one, Danuta.
You don't know her.


00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.512
Cristina is asleep?


00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.595
She's in the mountains,
with her friends.


00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.678
- When is she coming back?
- She's just left.


00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:21.319
- Doesn't she has a phone?
- There is no service there.


00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.118
What happened to Elena?


00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:33.079
What can I say...
It all started from a bloody appetize...


00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:37.873
She started to cook an appetizer
during the heat of this summer.


00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.318
I told her to leave
the fucking appetizer...


00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.150
And she said no,
because the eggplants would go bitter...


00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.235
And...


00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:54.912
This is Cristina's room.
I thought maybe you'd...


00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:56.589
Sleep tight.


00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.155
Good night.


00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:20.234
Yes... Yes, baby. Yes, I'm fine.


00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.715
I know. I love you too.


00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.314
Yeah, man...


00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.711
You sure you left it there, dude?


00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.838
It wasn't there, man...


00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:17.797
What a trip, man! Yeah, almost
got busted by the cops...


00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.956
Yeah, someone else must've found
it... Could've been the cops too...


00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:27.750
What about Johnny? How the hell
should I know what to tell him?


00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:33.994
Yeah. You'll figure something out!
Bye!


00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:09.070
Cris, we're rich! We're keeping this
for ourselves just 'cause we can!


00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.791
And we're selling the rest
at a higher price just 'cause we can...


00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:25.877
Imagine whatever you want.
Ibiza, Jamaica, Switzerland...


00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.475
Yeah...


00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.953
What do you mean, man? I'd never
pull that scam on you, you know me!


00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.914
Hey, it's closed!


00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.475
I'll beep you.


00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.757
- Hey, man! You deaf? It's closed!
- Do you have a light, please?


00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:55.348
- No, I don't smoke. Hey, man!
- It's bad for your health, right?


00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:56.989
- Right.
- Can you tell me what it's like?


00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:59.230
I mean, not smoking. You see, I may
have lung cancer or something...


00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:03.712
- Then quit smoking! Hey, man!
- ...'cause my spit looks like crap.


00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:05.592
Take some pills for sour throat.


00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:12.797
Well, I couldn't do that...
They make my tongue brown...


00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.155
Meaning?


00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:20.308
- You wanna see?
- Really?


00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.154
Did you bring it?


00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:45.037
- Wait a second, I wanna check it!
- No need to, I trust you!


00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:46.519
But I don't trust you. Let's go!


00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.955
You stay here!


00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.398
- I got a beep! I got a beep!
- What?


00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.988
Hey, scum bag, you wanna lose that
filthy thing of yours?


00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.199
You wanna lose it? I'll cut it off
in no time, scum bag, I will!


00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.439
Come on, man, hurry up!


00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:20.799
- Where's the fire?
- No fire, man.


00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.916
Then why are you in such a hurry
to get lost, dude?


00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:46.194
Glont! Glont? Glont!


00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:07.351
- Good morning!
- Mornin'!


00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.671
- Did you sleep well?
- I was a little restless...


00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.398
Well come on in,
don't just stand there!


00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.756
Toni will fix you a cup of coffee and
you'll feel as good as new in no time...


00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:16.030
- Do you remember Toni?
- Sure...


00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.795
- You want it filtered or Turkish?
- Turkish.


00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:22.434
How are you, Danuta?


00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:28.752
You like this? Here.


00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.712
- Thank you.
- You're welcome, dear.


00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.872
- Toni, this is for you.
- Thanks.


00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:34.878
So what do you think? Is it good?


00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.679
Wow, you came this close to
bringing me the entire Spain!


00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.876
- So what do you say, guys?
- Thank you!


00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.959
I left the presents for Elena and
Cristina in the other room.


00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:52.554
Listen, Sandu, how can I reach
Cristina? I'd really like to see her...


00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:57.438
Maybe Toni knows some friend of
hers who knows where she is...


00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:58.829
I'll ask him.


00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.271
If you hear from her, give her my
phone number, MK? Please.


00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:08.519
I will, but I don't think she'll call
You know how teens are...


00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:16.073
Alright. I'm going to see Elena
at the hospital now.


00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.952
Afterwards I'll pay Dad a short
visit too.


00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.714
Here's the thing: do you think you
can persuade the old man to sell?


00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.431
The doctors' fees are killing me!
I don't know how to get by anymore.


00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:31.798
Sometimes I think I would be better
off taking her to a... Um... Home...


00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:35.556
- God forbid! Take her to a home?
- What else can I do? You tell me!


00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:53.751
Isn't your mom beautiful?
Come sit next to her.


00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:04.392
You know, if you talk to Mommy,
she's gonna get well.


00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:08.953
- Daddy says she's gonna die.
- Really?


00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:12.755
Dad says if Mom dies,
he's gonna marry Miss Flori.


00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.914
- Who's Miss Flori?
- Some ugly woman.


00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:20.315
Listen, can you also tell me what
Daddy says about Cristina?


00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:22.630
- About Cristina?
- Yes.


00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.550
"Cristina, that filthy cow. "


00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.190
"Cristina, that goddamn tramp. "


00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:33.873
That's all I remember...


00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:39.432
- And what does Cristina say?
- Cristina got pissed off and left.


00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:45.235
- Where did she go?
- I dunno. She didn't come back.


00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.600
- When?
- A while ago.


00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.991
Good afternoon, where
can I find Mr. Groza?


00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.071
- Check inside.
- Thanks.


00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:02.997
- Good afternoon. Mr. Groza?
- 'Afternoon. The office straight ahe...


00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:12.157
- Hello, Sandu.
- Hey. You know, I feel so exhausted.


00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:14.197
Why didn't you tell me
about Cristina?


00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.270
Well... Excuse me, I have to get that...


00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:24.434
Hello? No, I don't want no tires.
You're all over me now!


00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:28.075
Yes, some nitrogen and some
oxygen tubes. That's all!


00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:34.589
- What can I say? She kindda left...
- Why didn't you tell me last night?


00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.954
I didn't want to upset you.
Would you like to get something to...


00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.593
No, I don't want anything!


00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.799
So what happened?


00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:48.356
She found herself a hard dick,
that's what happened!


00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:52.832
Hey, Gelu, stop using so much
shampoo! Use more water!


00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.070
What the hell? How many times
do I have to tell you?


00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.512
Why didn't you let me know?


00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:02.236
What for? What could you have done
from there? Have her tied up?


00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:05.796
There comes a time when people
go crazy and start acting weird.


00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.109
That's what you've done too, isn't it...


00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.719
So don't come to me and act
like you're some big shot!


00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.114
I'm the one who took care of her for
I got her off your back.


00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:13.875
- You got her off my back?
- When you came to me whining...


00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.230
You were afraid to go to your father
knocked up...


00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:17.873
...and with no husband, remember?


00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.996
You know what Father's like.
What was I supposed to do?


00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:24.398
Raise her on your own, that's what!


00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:34.838
Where do I leave you, Ma'am?


00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:40.550
- At the University.
- Fine, at the University.


00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.237
- You haven't changed a bit.
- Neither have you.


00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:07.398
- Sit down, please. Coffee?
- No, thanks.


00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:13.516
- When did you arrive?
- Last night. Elena's had a stroke.


00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:18.909
I'm sorry to hear that. How about you
How's everything going?


00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:24.151
Fine. Felix, do you know anything
about Cristina?


00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:28.272
No, why? Is something wrong?


00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:32.117
Cristina's run away from home.
I don't know what happened.


00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.514
I was kind of hoping
you know something...


00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:38.595
But you shouldn't panic,
she'll get by...


00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.158
- Thanks.
- Kids like her always do.


00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.077
What is that supposed to mean?


00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:50.478
I've got plenty of cases
like hers here:


00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:56.072
...the psychosocial consequences of
parent abandonment. I'm the author.


00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.758
What cases are you talking about?


00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.078
Children abandoned involuntarily:
their mothers left to work abroad...


00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:06.118
...and their fathers can't take care
of them, so they leave this job...


00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.879
...to other families.
Such children feel underprivileged...


00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.679
...in front of the legitimate offspring
of their adoptive family.


00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.475
It's really interesting, you know.
I'll write a book about her.


00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:18.348
Do you actually realize it's our
child you're talking about, Felix?


00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:35.068
Hello, Toni. Silvia, you say?
Silvia what?


00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.676
MK... And where's that?


00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:43.075
Have you talked to her?
Alright, it's MK. Thanks.


00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.476
Mh, I checked in at the
Mpera Hotel.


00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:02.828
Silvia?


00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.988
I'm Cristina's mother.
We've talked earlier on the phone.


00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:11.835
Mh, cool! I'm Silvia.


00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:15.635
Nice to meet you. Er... Can I ask
you a few questions about Cristina?


00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:18.311
- Got a cigarette?
- Yes.


00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:22.874
Thanks. I'm out of cash. Somebody
was supposed to bring me some, but...


00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.996
Do you know where
I can find Cristina?


00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.919
Does my face show?


00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:31.191
Come on, focus, please. Tell me
where to find her. I'll take that!


00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:35.279
- You tell me if my face shows!
- No, why?


00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:38.676
That's good. As long as my face
doesn't show, it's all good...


00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:41.955
Don't know where you can find her.


00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.598
But it must be in Bucharest...


00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.996
Where in Bucharest? When was
the last time you spoke with her?


00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.797
I'm not sure, New Years' Eve
I think...


00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.476
Where was she then? Was she MK?


00:17:56.320 --> 00:18:00.836
She was just fine. Both of them
were - She and her boyfriend...


00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:04.157
- What's the name of this guy?
- Glont.


00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:09.119
- Glont who?
- I don't know. Just Glont.


00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:14.596
Do you know where I can find this
Glont guy?


00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.954
- "Twice".
- What's that?


00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.751
You know what?
How 'bout I give you Dita's number...


00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.795
- Who?
- Dita. He's working with Glont.


00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.952
They've been friends
since high school.


00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:34.432
I'll give you his number, but you
have to call him after 10 o'clock.


00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.313
- MK.
- Tell him you got it from... Lizuca.


00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:42.478
Like the name of that character in
"The Magic Woods", get it?


00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:04.796
Mr. Dita? We've talked on the phone
earlier.


00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.953
I got your number from Silvia
or Lizuca or whatever...


00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.798
I'm actually looking for Glont.


00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:14.072
Mr, more specifically, for
Cristina. I'm her mother.


00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.553
- Good evening.
- Yeah, so?


00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:20.757
So... Lizuca told me you know
Cristina's boyfriend, Glont.


00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.233
She said you went to the same
school together.


00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:23.315
That's right.


00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:24.793
- And that you're friends with him.
- True.


00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.035
Do you know how I can find him?


00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.912
A phone number, an address,
anything...


00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.389
Yeah...


00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.594
Wait here.


00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.830
- Are you Cris' mother?
- Yes.


00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.556
- Cool! I'm Dorothy.
- Luiza.


00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:46.591
- As in...
- "The Wizard of Mz", I know.


00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:50.275
Nice to meet you.
It's milkshake.


00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:52.869
Excuse me...


00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.239
He doesn't answer the phone.


00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.478
I really have to find him.
Can you try to phone him again?


00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.160
Maybe he answers.
Silvia said something about "Twice"...


00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:12.475
Yeah, man.


00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:19.473
We're in "Twice". Wait, I'll come
downstairs right now. See ya!


00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:26.157
It was Dacos... I'll be right back.
Here.


00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:17.470
- That lipstick's hot!
- You like it? Here, you take it.


00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:21.552
- It's too red for my taste.
- You serious?


00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:24.594
Sure. And it's not like I paid for it
it was a gift.


00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:35.279
It looks good on you.


00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:38.150
It's too cool to say no. Thanks.


00:22:45.280 --> 00:22:46.508
What?


00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:50.117
Don't you remember me at all?


00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:53.428
No, I don't.


00:22:56.880 --> 00:22:58.313
I'm your mother...


00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:03.237
No shit! You're kidding, right?


00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:05.315
No.


00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:10.115
Then what the fuck are you doing in
Romania? I thought you were away.


00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:12.755
I came back.


00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:18.075
Man, it's like a bad movie...
So you were like following me?


00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:21.037
- Yes, I've been looking for you.
- What for?


00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:26.593
I wanted to see you.
I wanted to talk to you.


00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:28.035
What about?


00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:33.396
You wanna give me money
so you can make it up to me?


00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:37.635
I mean, you can give me money
if you want to...


00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:40.351
If you wanna prove
how much you love me.


00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:46.594
How much?


00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:50.074
How much... 3,000 euros.


00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:54.190
MK, I can give it to you tomorrow.


00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:58.628
But promise me we're gonna talk for
at least one hour.


00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:00.916
Do I get 6,000 if we talk for
two hours?


00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:05.876
Cristina, I know you have all the
reasons in the world to hate me, to...


00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:06.955
Get lost!


00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:16.628
I'll pretend I had a bad trip...


00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:22.918
Mne in which my mother's ghost
walked into the toilet...


00:24:23.800 --> 00:24:25.518
Then we'll both forget
we've ever met!


00:24:30.040 --> 00:24:31.996
Fuck this, I can't spend one normal
evening in the city...


00:24:32.120 --> 00:24:33.872
...without all the shitheads
fucking it up for me!


00:24:38.120 --> 00:24:39.394
Then I'll see you tomorrow.


00:24:41.280 --> 00:24:43.236
As for the talking part,
we'll see about that!


00:24:52.920 --> 00:24:54.558
How 'bout I fix us a quick one?


00:24:55.120 --> 00:24:56.269
Yeah, good idea.


00:25:02.400 --> 00:25:04.960
Man, are we fucking lucky or what?
Can you believe this luck?


00:25:05.160 --> 00:25:07.151
You still have a long way to go till
you raise all the money.


00:25:07.280 --> 00:25:10.511
Yeah, I'm just saying we're so lucky
with this coming out of the blue!


00:25:12.680 --> 00:25:14.955
Hey, listen, you think you
could ask her for some more?


00:25:16.200 --> 00:25:19.272
Look, I really don't wanna have
anything to to with her or her money.


00:25:19.400 --> 00:25:23.393
- Know what I mean?
- I know you hate her as it is.


00:25:23.520 --> 00:25:25.875
But remember we owe 10,000 euros,
not 3,000...


00:25:27.440 --> 00:25:28.998
We'll get by somehow.


00:25:36.520 --> 00:25:37.589
Listen...


00:25:38.480 --> 00:25:42.439
What if tomorrow she actually
intends to give us more?


00:25:42.560 --> 00:25:43.993
We're in for it, right?


00:25:45.280 --> 00:25:46.679
I don't know, we'll see.


00:25:52.560 --> 00:25:55.632
I mean, what the fuck? If she wants
to pay, then let her pay it all!


00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:02.434
Look, I just wanna erase this whole
thing from my head, get it?


00:26:02.600 --> 00:26:03.874
I really do!


00:26:40.520 --> 00:26:42.238
I thought you weren't coming
anymore.


00:26:43.040 --> 00:26:44.189
- Hello.
- You must be...


00:26:44.320 --> 00:26:45.753
- Lonut.
- Luiza.


00:26:45.880 --> 00:26:49.111
Nice to meet you. Sorry we're late;
we couldn't find a parking space...


00:26:49.280 --> 00:26:52.829
It's alright. Would you like to go
somewhere more quiet for a talk?


00:26:52.960 --> 00:26:53.995
- Sure!
- Not really.


00:26:54.840 --> 00:26:56.751
Mh, I went over to the bank and got
the money.


00:26:56.880 --> 00:26:58.836
- Do you need it in local currency?
- No, we don't.


00:26:59.440 --> 00:27:01.874
Do you mind my asking what
the money is for? You got debts?


00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:04.230
Yeah, sort of... Afriend of ours
helped us a while ago...


00:27:04.360 --> 00:27:07.318
...when there was a fire at our place.
So now we have to pay him back...


00:27:08.200 --> 00:27:11.829
Well, anyway, thanks a lot.
I mean, it's quite a lot of money...


00:27:13.520 --> 00:27:16.398
- I'd like us to talk some more...
- That makes one of us.


00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:20.193
I'm going over to my father's today.
Would you like to come?


00:27:20.920 --> 00:27:24.151
- In the countryside?
- Yes, he'd be happy to see you...


00:27:24.280 --> 00:27:28.592
- I have stuff to do this weekend...
- I'll take care of that for you.


00:27:28.720 --> 00:27:30.472
- Really, you can go. It's MK.
- Thanks, but no thanks.


00:27:30.640 --> 00:27:33.279
- It's MK if you don't want to come...
- I thought I was clear about that.


00:27:34.800 --> 00:27:37.792
- Come on, it's only one weekend.
- Have you lost it, dude?


00:27:38.160 --> 00:27:41.072
All you gotta do is act like you're
mommie's girl, have some brandy...


00:27:41.200 --> 00:27:43.555
...and some corn mush with them and
return with 10,000 euros in your pock...


00:27:43.720 --> 00:27:44.675
This isn't happening...


00:27:44.800 --> 00:27:47.473
We're in deep shit and you wanna
waste this opportunity?


00:27:47.920 --> 00:27:49.239
Where else can we get the money
from?


00:27:53.280 --> 00:27:55.157
Can I stop by my place to get some
clothes and stuff?


00:27:55.760 --> 00:28:00.675
- Yeah, sure. The bus leaves at 4.
- The bus? I'll send my chauffeur!


00:28:01.040 --> 00:28:03.508
- You have a... Chauffeur?
- It's just a manner of speaking...


00:28:03.640 --> 00:28:05.119
It's a guy who helps me out
every once in a while.


00:28:09.880 --> 00:28:12.348
- What's keeping him?
- He's gotta put some gas...


00:28:12.480 --> 00:28:14.789
- He's got stuff of his own to do.
- I should give you some money.


00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:18.037
Relax, Ma'am, it's on me.
My treat, so to speak.


00:28:18.920 --> 00:28:21.639
- Anything for my mother-in-law!
- Mh, put a sock in it!


00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:25.752
So how's school and everything?


00:28:26.080 --> 00:28:28.230
I'm on my way to graduate
the Romanian-American University.


00:28:28.400 --> 00:28:30.960
- What's that?
- Business, finance, stuff like that.


00:28:32.560 --> 00:28:35.279
- What about you, Cris?
- What about me?


00:28:35.800 --> 00:28:37.358
What do you plan on doing next?


00:28:38.480 --> 00:28:40.914
You mean when I grow up and shit?


00:28:42.000 --> 00:28:43.558
Yes, something like that.


00:28:45.320 --> 00:28:46.799
I don't know, but I guess you can
come up with something...


00:28:46.920 --> 00:28:49.354
...now that you're here and you care
so much about my future and stuff.


00:28:49.520 --> 00:28:50.555
He's here!


00:28:56.600 --> 00:28:59.717
- Hey... How are you, bro?
- Hey, man! Everything ok?


00:29:02.600 --> 00:29:03.828
Thanks a lot, dude!


00:29:04.600 --> 00:29:06.556
This lady here is Cris' mother.
She's come from Spain.


00:29:06.920 --> 00:29:08.319
- I'm Luiza.
- Costica.


00:29:16.320 --> 00:29:20.279
Allow me... Let me get you your bags.
There we go...


00:29:20.400 --> 00:29:22.834
- I left the money on the table.
- You'll be there around 7, right?


00:29:23.280 --> 00:29:25.555
- Goodbye, nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you too.


00:29:25.720 --> 00:29:28.109
Maybe you'll stop by our place when
you come back. We'll have some tea...


00:29:28.280 --> 00:29:30.032
- Yeah, sure... Bye!
- Goodbye.


00:29:35.720 --> 00:29:38.154
Yes, man.
It's being taken care of.


00:29:56.400 --> 00:30:01.235
Do you like this music? I can play
something else if you want.


00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:03.152
Reggae perhaps?


00:30:04.200 --> 00:30:06.634
- Bob Marley!
- No, this one's just fine.


00:30:22.720 --> 00:30:24.358
Hey, pull over for a second!


00:30:35.280 --> 00:30:36.474
Are you MK?


00:30:37.320 --> 00:30:38.833
- No.
- What's wrong?


00:30:39.320 --> 00:30:40.992
I think I'm having an attack.


00:30:41.640 --> 00:30:42.755
A panic attack?


00:30:42.960 --> 00:30:45.918
Don't worry about it, I just got
a little scared, that's all.


00:30:47.040 --> 00:30:49.554
Yeah, these attacks really suck!
What causes yours?


00:30:51.320 --> 00:30:54.517
I haven't met my father since the
time I got pregnant with you.


00:31:21.280 --> 00:31:22.508
Father?


00:31:32.760 --> 00:31:36.594
- Hello, Father.
- Hey, welcome!


00:31:41.600 --> 00:31:44.319
- Did they fix the road?
- Yes.


00:31:44.480 --> 00:31:47.040
Well, that's a surprise...


00:31:52.280 --> 00:31:56.558
- What are you doing here?
- Trying to get rid of these moles.


00:31:56.680 --> 00:31:58.477
They're all over the place
this year!


00:31:58.840 --> 00:32:01.752
- Welcome.
- I couldn't visit you any sooner.


00:32:02.720 --> 00:32:05.951
- But at least I'm here now.
- So you are. I'm happy to see you.


00:32:06.400 --> 00:32:11.076
- Father, meet my girl, Cristina.
- Hello.


00:32:11.240 --> 00:32:15.028
- Do you know her?
- Where could I know her from?


00:32:16.080 --> 00:32:20.073
Hello. Now that you're here, let's
sit on that bench over there!


00:32:20.240 --> 00:32:25.155
Come on! Look what I have here!


00:32:31.760 --> 00:32:36.754
- Sandu would like to talk to you...
- What, you're his lawyer now?


00:32:39.280 --> 00:32:45.230
