- No, it's your onion.


00:32:46.320 --> 00:32:47.514
Grandpa...


00:32:48.520 --> 00:32:50.476
The onion's a present from Spain.


00:32:52.680 --> 00:32:54.955
You can tell she's your granddaughter
She's just like you.


00:32:55.080 --> 00:32:59.551
Perhaps, I just can't remember her.
I can't remember any of you!


00:33:01.040 --> 00:33:03.600
