00:33:04.040 --> 00:33:07.077
- Come on, why do you say that?
- You know very well why...


00:33:11.360 --> 00:33:13.954
This isn't real onion.
It's not mine!


00:33:25.160 --> 00:33:28.869
This is real onion, my onion!


00:33:35.440 --> 00:33:37.556
- Did you find out about Elena?
- What about Elena?


00:33:38.400 --> 00:33:40.595
- She's ill. Didn't they tell you?
- No.


00:33:40.960 --> 00:33:43.679
She's got... She had a stroke.


00:33:47.240 --> 00:33:49.231
I can't believe they didn't mention
anything to you.


00:33:49.360 --> 00:33:52.477
At least now you know what kind of
man Sandu is. I'm going for a walk.


00:34:20.720 --> 00:34:24.713
Cristina? Cristina!


00:34:29.920 --> 00:34:31.319
Cristina...


00:34:38.440 --> 00:34:40.351
Could you...


00:34:41.760 --> 00:34:42.715
What?


00:34:45.360 --> 00:34:47.749
