00:34:54.800 --> 00:34:57.758
I'll write the message for you,
just tell me what to write.


00:35:01.440 --> 00:35:02.429
Cristina?


00:35:03.720 --> 00:35:10.751
No... I don't want to...


00:35:14.560 --> 00:35:17.632
