00:50:08.720 --> 00:50:14.670
Well, Cristina, I'll leave you to
Andrada, the nicest girl on Earth...


00:50:15.440 --> 00:50:18.989
...who's going to take you do some
tests. Just to see where we stand.


00:50:19.360 --> 00:50:23.148
Mom will stay here with me. I won't
let her go anywhere, don't worry.


00:50:30.680 --> 00:50:35.117
- So, Mrs. Groza...
- My name is Sanchez. She is...


00:50:35.920 --> 00:50:38.070
She's got her father's name,
I get it.


00:50:39.560 --> 00:50:42.199
Actually, it's my brother-in-law's
name...


00:50:45.120 --> 00:50:47.588
I left the country when Cristina
was 3 and a half.


00:50:54.800 --> 00:50:56.472
She was raised by my sister...


00:50:58.640 --> 00:51:01.074
But I talked to her on the phone,
I sent her money...


00:51:01.640 --> 00:51:03.392
She had everything she
could've wished for...


00:51:06.960 --> 00:51:08.871
Alright, I didn't state
the contrary...


00:51:09.880 --> 00:51:11.836
Yes, it's just that you give me
this look...


00:51:13.280 --> 00:51:15.794
And what would be the right look
in this situation?


00:51:34.080 --> 00:51:37.629
Glont? Get me out of here, please!


00:51:40.040 --> 00:51:44.079
Where are you? What the fuck are
you doing in the mountains...


00:51:44.200 --> 00:51:47.909
...while I'm stuck in this rat hole?
Can't you leave for a little while...


00:51:48.040 --> 00:51:51.112
...and come pick me up
I'm dying in here!


00:51:52.280 --> 00:51:54.271
Hello. And how are my pretty young
ladies today?


00:51:55.320 --> 00:51:58.710
You're going to get me upset, you kno
You promised me something!


00:51:59.840 --> 00:52:03.469
- Give me your phone...
- I can't take it anymore.


00:52:05.320 --> 00:52:06.594
I wanna go home!


00:52:07.320 --> 00:52:11.677
You promised you wanted to get well.
For that, you have to behave.


00:52:13.160 --> 00:52:17.199
I promise I'll keep clean. I talked t
Glont about it and we're both gonna q


00:52:17.360 --> 00:52:18.793
But I can't stay here anymore.


00:52:18.960 --> 00:52:20.996
Everything just narrows down on me...
I'm claustrophobic!


00:52:21.400 --> 00:52:22.913
- They're so itchy!
- Itchy?


00:52:23.160 --> 00:52:24.195
The blankets!


00:52:26.360 --> 00:52:28.271
Give me my phone back,
I wanna call Glont.


00:52:28.880 --> 00:52:31.792
Your mother called. She wants to
know if she can come by to see you.


00:52:34.400 --> 00:52:35.674
Tell her I'm asleep.


00:52:37.440 --> 00:52:39.351
She's not even my mother!


00:52:41.360 --> 00:52:44.670
She came all the way from Spain
just to fuck my day.


00:52:45.680 --> 00:52:47.398
- Good afternoon.
- Good afternoon.


00:52:48.800 --> 00:52:50.552
Did the nurse tell you?


00:52:52.080 --> 00:52:53.479
Cristina refuses to see me.


00:52:53.880 --> 00:52:56.519
Madam, that should be
the least of your worries...


00:52:57.240 --> 00:52:59.071
She'll get over it in 2 or 3 days.


00:52:59.200 --> 00:53:01.839
The problem is what will happen
to her when she gets out of here.


00:53:02.920 --> 00:53:04.319
Who is she staying with?


00:53:05.120 --> 00:53:07.714
- Her boyfriend.
- That's real problem!


00:53:08.280 --> 00:53:10.510
Did you know he tried to get her
out of here last night?


00:53:11.200 --> 00:53:12.155
No.


00:53:12.600 --> 00:53:14.989
Do everything you can to rid her
of this boy, Madam!


00:53:16.400 --> 00:53:21.633
Methadone alone won't fix the problem
It can diminish the addiction...


00:53:21.760 --> 00:53:24.069
...if taken on a regular basis
and for a long time.


00:53:24.560 --> 00:53:28.997
But if the girl stays in the same cir
she's going to start over.


00:53:29.760 --> 00:53:30.954
It's always like that...


00:53:31.760 --> 00:53:34.320
- I love you a lot.
- How much?


00:53:35.920 --> 00:53:37.638
- Enough.
- Enough?


00:53:41.240 --> 00:53:42.195
Bye!


00:53:42.760 --> 00:53:44.557
- Cris!
- Hello!


00:53:44.920 --> 00:53:47.434
- What are you doing?
- I came to see Cristina.


00:53:48.720 --> 00:53:54.716
Listen! If you ever approach
less than 20 meters from Cristina...


00:53:55.200 --> 00:53:56.315
...you won't be fine.


00:53:57.080 --> 00:53:58.035
What?


00:53:58.760 --> 00:54:02.275
You just forget about Cristina.
Erase her number in your address book...


00:54:03.240 --> 00:54:06.232
What if I approach
less than 20 meters from her?


00:54:07.520 --> 00:54:08.635
You won't like it.


00:54:10.160 --> 00:54:14.153
- I can't guarantee that.
- Think about it.


00:54:16.160 --> 00:54:19.596
MK, let's say I leave her alone.
What do I get?


00:54:23.880 --> 00:54:27.156
- How much do you need?
- 8,000 euros.


00:54:28.760 --> 00:54:30.113
Pretty cheap.


00:54:31.600 --> 00:54:35.229
- 10,000 and I never see her again.
- All right.


00:54:37.080 --> 00:54:39.389
And I tell you of drug dealing.


00:55:13.840 --> 00:55:15.478
- Hello.
- Good afternoon.


00:55:15.600 --> 00:55:17.636
Let's go.


00:55:18.840 --> 00:55:22.469
- Glont told me he'd pick me up.
- We decided that I'd do it.


00:55:22.640 --> 00:55:27.111
- It's MK, he picks me up.
- Cristina, I spoke with him.


00:55:27.520 --> 00:55:31.035
- He's not coming anymore.
- Let me call him myself!


00:55:31.280 --> 00:55:33.840
I'm telling you the two of us talked
and he said I can come pick you up.


00:55:34.400 --> 00:55:36.436
We have to go to the methadone
center to register.


00:55:36.560 --> 00:55:38.278
We promised the doctor we would...


00:55:38.720 --> 00:55:40.790
Do you really want
to spend more time in here?


00:55:54.000 --> 00:55:55.797
The moron keeps rejecting my calls.


00:55:57.320 --> 00:55:58.548
You can drop me at my place.


00:55:58.720 --> 00:56:01.917
No, you're coming with me to the hote
You and I are staying together.


00:56:03.680 --> 00:56:05.511
Staying together?
What do you mean?


00:56:05.720 --> 00:56:09.315
You heard me. We'll "hang out"
together. Isn't that how you call it...


00:56:11.120 --> 00:56:14.715
I can't believe this! What the fuck
do you want from me?


00:56:15.360 --> 00:56:18.238
Why the fuck do you barge into my
shitty life like this? Back off!


00:56:18.680 --> 00:56:20.511
And what the fuck did you tell
Glont to make him avoid me?


00:56:20.640 --> 00:56:21.709
You fuckin' paid him or what?


00:56:21.840 --> 00:56:26.356
Miss, I won't tolerate
this kind of language in my car.


00:56:26.840 --> 00:56:29.229
You may be
used to it from home, but...


00:56:31.040 --> 00:56:31.995
Cris!


00:56:32.600 --> 00:56:34.477
Move on, you don't own the fuckin'
street! You mother fucker!


00:56:34.600 --> 00:56:37.068
What's your problem, asshole?
Fuck off, dickhead!


00:56:37.200 --> 00:56:39.760
- Please excuse us... Come on, Cris!
- Blow me!... Jerk-off!


00:56:42.520 --> 00:56:44.670
He almost had a heart attack.
Did you see the jerk's face?


00:56:45.280 --> 00:56:48.033
Go on! What?


00:56:51.160 --> 00:56:53.355
Why don't we sit there
for a second, to catch our breaths?


00:56:54.600 --> 00:56:55.874
Come on, it's a nice place.


00:57:00.920 --> 00:57:02.478
How would you like to come
with me?


00:57:03.240 --> 00:57:05.071
You could use a holiday in Spain...


00:57:09.240 --> 00:57:10.673
I want to see my Andreea...


00:57:13.800 --> 00:57:15.597
I fuckin' miss her like crazy.


00:57:20.920 --> 00:57:22.035
Where is she now?


00:57:24.360 --> 00:57:25.395
A home.


00:57:33.280 --> 00:57:34.508
Is she Sandu's child?


00:57:41.800 --> 00:57:45.315
Are you high or something?
Fuckin' soap operas...


00:57:46.360 --> 00:57:48.749
My life is less complicated than
yours, Mom...


00:57:49.800 --> 00:57:54.590
Andreea's father died in a bike accid
He rammed into a truck.


00:57:56.640 --> 00:57:57.868
Andreea was 3 months old
at the time...


00:57:58.000 --> 00:58:00.230
...and I've raised her the best way
I knew how ever since.


00:58:04.320 --> 00:58:05.548
We'll take her with us.


00:58:08.800 --> 00:58:12.110
- Do you really mean it?
- Yes, I do.


00:58:15.800 --> 00:58:19.998
- Does your family know about me?
- No...


00:58:21.040 --> 00:58:23.429
So you gonna keep us hidden
under the bed or something?


00:58:24.520 --> 00:58:26.158
Don't worry about that.


00:58:30.480 --> 00:58:35.554
Mf course I'd love to come...
Although I barely know you...


00:58:38.680 --> 00:58:39.829
But yes!


00:58:57.480 --> 00:59:02.600
Look how beautiful she is,
just like a little doll, see?


00:59:10.800 --> 00:59:15.396
How you doin', crocodile?


00:59:15.520 --> 00:59:18.910
Say that to Mommy:
how you doin', crocodile?


00:59:22.200 --> 00:59:25.237
- Let me kiss your tiny hand.
- I'll go talk to the manager.


00:59:26.080 --> 00:59:28.150
We're taking her with us
for good, MK?


00:59:30.960 --> 00:59:38.469
Let me kiss your tiny hand... Higher.
Higher still... I'll eat you up!


00:59:43.280 --> 00:59:44.508
Mommy's coming to get you!


00:59:44.680 --> 00:59:45.635
Upsy daisy!


00:59:54.480 --> 01:00:02.313
That's it.
Mommy's taking you.


01:00:04.000 --> 01:00:05.115
Did you like it?


01:00:05.240 --> 01:00:09.631
Look at Mommy!
That's it...


01:00:09.880 --> 01:00:16.831
My love...


01:00:16.960 --> 01:00:18.951
Let's dry the baby...


01:00:24.480 --> 01:00:28.792
L- M-A-R...
With your little mouth...


01:00:30.080 --> 01:00:32.310
It fell down...


01:00:32.440 --> 01:00:33.953
Look what I got for you!


01:00:34.400 --> 01:00:36.311
Mh, my, let's see what she
has for you!


01:00:40.120 --> 01:00:41.439
Would you look at that?


01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:44.878
- Say thank... You...
- You...


01:00:45.000 --> 01:00:46.479
- Very much!
- Very much!


01:00:46.600 --> 01:00:49.353
Go ahead, take it...
Should Mommy open it for you?


01:00:52.600 --> 01:00:54.079
What if I change my mind?


01:00:55.080 --> 01:00:57.992
I'll lose some money... Come on,
drink up, it's getting cold.


01:01:04.560 --> 01:01:06.471
She keeps dreaming of crocodiles!


01:01:06.600 --> 01:01:08.670
We'll take her to the Zoo,
to see some real ones.


01:01:09.800 --> 01:01:14.430
I have a trip of my own...
With polar bears... Three of them...


01:01:15.720 --> 01:01:19.918
- The big one, Doru, the middle one...
- ...Nicu...


01:01:20.680 --> 01:01:23.592
- ...And the small one...
- ...Tiny Muc...


01:01:27.160 --> 01:01:30.072
- You heard it too?
- I'm the one who came up with it!


01:01:31.240 --> 01:01:32.275
Really?


01:01:33.080 --> 01:01:35.913
Yes, I used to tell it to you when
you were a baby.


01:01:39.000 --> 01:01:40.035
Cool!


01:01:43.920 --> 01:01:46.514
Polar bears really soothe me...


01:01:48.840 --> 01:01:52.116
- I have this trip when...
- What?


01:01:54.080 --> 01:01:55.638
- Never mind...
- Come on, you can tell me...


01:01:55.800 --> 01:01:58.075
- It's nothing...
- I don't buy it, Cris.


01:02:02.200 --> 01:02:03.189
MK...


01:02:05.960 --> 01:02:07.279
Look at her...


01:02:22.440 --> 01:02:23.634
It's Glont...


01:02:25.040 --> 01:02:27.759
- I don't want him near you again!
- Yeah, I know.


01:02:27.880 --> 01:02:30.110
But I still have to tell him
I'm leaving, right?


01:02:30.280 --> 01:02:32.271
And I gotta get my stuff from his pla...


01:02:34.080 --> 01:02:36.196
Look, crocodile,
your Grandpa's here!


01:02:46.960 --> 01:02:49.235
- Meet Cristina.
- We've already met on the phone.


01:02:49.560 --> 01:02:51.915
We have? Yes, we have...


01:02:53.040 --> 01:02:58.160
And this is Andreea, Cris' daughter,
and your granddaughter.


01:03:00.240 --> 01:03:02.117
Would you like some cookies?
Theey've got really good ones...


01:03:02.760 --> 01:03:04.193
No, I would like...


01:03:05.360 --> 01:03:08.875
- Adouble vodka, to ease the shock?
- No, just a cu of coffee, please.


01:03:09.680 --> 01:03:11.352
So I take it you wrote
an essey about me.


01:03:11.960 --> 01:03:14.110
- Yes. I mean no!
- What does it say?


01:03:14.480 --> 01:03:21.113
It's a book about children living
in abnormal families.


01:03:21.240 --> 01:03:23.800
I mean children who... You know...


01:03:23.960 --> 01:03:27.350
- Cool! You are a deputy dean...
- He's a deputy rector.


01:03:27.520 --> 01:03:30.114
- That's right.
- Why didn't you ever look for me?


01:03:31.920 --> 01:03:35.390
I mean, I understand. Mom was abroad,
but you have no excuse.


01:03:35.960 --> 01:03:37.598
What kind of father are you?


01:03:38.560 --> 01:03:40.232
- You're making fun of me...
- Not at all.


01:03:40.360 --> 01:03:41.952
Would you dare to make fun of me?


01:03:45.040 --> 01:03:47.873
- Tell me, do you still love Luiza?
- Cris...


01:03:48.000 --> 01:03:51.675
- She still loves you.
- Life is much more complicated.


01:03:52.240 --> 01:03:56.392
- You'll figure it out one day...
- I'm 19 and a half...


01:03:56.520 --> 01:03:59.114
I'd say I'm already capable
to figure it out... I even have a kid...


01:03:59.320 --> 01:04:00.753
So I'm fully grown up.


01:04:02.120 --> 01:04:06.432
If you'd use your teaching skills,
I'm sure you'd make me understand.


01:04:06.600 --> 01:04:10.036
You're father's a professor,
so his explanations might just be...


01:04:10.200 --> 01:04:12.031
...too hard to understand
for both of us.


01:04:17.560 --> 01:04:19.391
This is for you...


01:04:21.400 --> 01:04:22.469
That's a hell of a trip.


01:04:24.360 --> 01:04:26.476
- And this one is for you.
- Thanks.


01:04:26.720 --> 01:04:28.438
I've been looking forward to this.


01:04:30.240 --> 01:04:35.951
Mother, father and granddaughter.
Another reunited family.


01:04:44.000 --> 01:04:46.116
Cris, it's me.


01:04:48.760 --> 01:04:50.671
I fixed you breakfast.
It's over here.


01:04:53.200 --> 01:04:55.634
Are you MK? Did you sleep well?


01:04:56.800 --> 01:05:00.349
Yeah, I just wasn't sure what
reality I woke up in...


01:05:01.320 --> 01:05:03.754
I have to get going now.
I need to go some places...


01:05:03.920 --> 01:05:07.151
I have to check on Elena, I haven't h
from her since I left the countryside...


01:05:08.080 --> 01:05:09.991
When are you guys going to get
the passport?


01:05:11.120 --> 01:05:15.796
- They open at 2.
- Alright, make sure you get there.


01:05:16.000 --> 01:05:18.594
And don't forget to take
your methadone. Please.


01:05:19.800 --> 01:05:21.870
Don't worry, that's one thing
you can't forget.


01:05:22.920 --> 01:05:23.909
Alright then.


01:05:26.560 --> 01:05:29.028
- Give Elena a kiss from me.
- I will. Bye.


01:05:49.360 --> 01:05:52.272
- What's up with you?
- Johnny sent lani and Dacos...


01:05:54.000 --> 01:05:57.231
- He's expecting the money tonight.
- Shhh. Let's go to the balcony.


01:06:13.400 --> 01:06:14.992
Can you give Johnny a call?


01:06:15.720 --> 01:06:16.948
What can I possibly tell him?


01:06:17.960 --> 01:06:19.996
These guys will kill me, man!
Do you want them to kill me?


01:06:21.920 --> 01:06:23.069
Give me your phone.


01:06:37.880 --> 01:06:39.029
It's switched off.


01:06:42.640 --> 01:06:45.712
Well, that's what happens when you
can't stay away from trouble...


01:06:45.840 --> 01:06:49.753
You were in this too! Don't deny it,
you touched Johnny's stash too!


01:06:49.880 --> 01:06:52.075
All there's left for you to say
is that you did it for me!


01:06:52.480 --> 01:06:56.189
Mh, and thanks a lot for pulling
out after that talk with my mother!


01:06:56.360 --> 01:06:59.158
Why do you have to take it like that
You know I'm in deep shit...


01:06:59.320 --> 01:07:02.790
...and I gotta get out of it fast!
Can't you see how fucked up this is?


01:07:04.760 --> 01:07:07.797
Besides, I knew she was gonna take
care of you. So they fixed you up...


01:07:09.040 --> 01:07:10.553
Yes, I'm on methadone.


01:07:11.160 --> 01:07:13.071
Really? Can I have one?


01:07:14.160 --> 01:07:16.720
You need a prescription for that.
Go to the hospital and get one...


01:07:17.080 --> 01:07:18.798
Come on, I just wanna taste it...


01:07:22.760 --> 01:07:24.671
I'm going to Spain with my mother.


01:07:26.920 --> 01:07:29.639
You are? How long are you staying?


01:07:32.080 --> 01:07:34.833
As long as I want to.
Maybe for ever.


01:07:37.080 --> 01:07:38.718
I'll get a job or something...


01:07:40.600 --> 01:07:43.034
I've taken Andreea from the home
and we'll both stay at my mother's.


01:07:43.160 --> 01:07:46.835
Great, so you don't know how long
you're gonna stay. What about us?


01:07:47.760 --> 01:07:49.830
- What about us?
- Us!


01:07:52.680 --> 01:07:53.874
I don't know.


01:07:55.640 --> 01:07:56.789
Great!


01:07:58.840 --> 01:08:01.035
- I wanna quit.
- So do I, Cris, but...


01:08:01.160 --> 01:08:03.594
- And I want us to take a break.
- Man, she's brainwashed you!


01:08:03.760 --> 01:08:07.196
- Fuck you!
- You too! Fuckin' retard!


01:08:08.120 --> 01:08:09.553
You sure you wanna do this?


01:08:10.200 --> 01:08:13.192
- Do what?
- Go to fucking Spain and shit!


01:08:13.600 --> 01:08:16.114
- And break up with me...
- Yes, I'm sure I wanna do this.


01:08:16.760 --> 01:08:19.320
What about me?
What am I gonna do, Cris?


01:08:31.360 --> 01:08:32.554
Come on, call the guy.


01:08:43.200 --> 01:08:44.349
Hello, Johnny.


01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:14.194
Hello.


01:09:15.000 --> 01:09:17.070
Hey, you're right on time.


01:09:24.840 --> 01:09:26.478
There's no one here to help me.


01:09:28.560 --> 01:09:33.156
Let's switch places for a second.
I'll go check on that porridge.


01:10:33.360 --> 01:10:34.349
Cristina?


01:10:44.240 --> 01:10:45.195
Cristina?


01:10:57.960 --> 01:10:58.949
What?


01:11:00.760 --> 01:11:04.309
Er... Dunno, you didn't use to be
so high on religion and shit...


01:11:04.720 --> 01:11:07.029
Such is life... It changes people.


01:11:12.280 --> 01:11:15.556
How are you, Cris?
How's your life going?


01:11:16.680 --> 01:11:18.750
Well, I haven't changed that much...


01:11:19.720 --> 01:11:21.995
I've thought a lot
about you lately.


01:11:25.240 --> 01:11:26.593
Maybe that's why you
called me today...


01:11:26.720 --> 01:11:29.518
- Why would that be?
- Cause I thought a lot about you?


01:11:29.640 --> 01:11:33.918
Mh, well, I've thought a lot
about you too lately!


01:11:35.120 --> 01:11:40.513
Yeah. Anyway, I wanted to talk to
you about a friend of mine...


01:11:42.560 --> 01:11:45.154
He did a really stupid thing, he
tampered with some of your stash...


01:11:47.520 --> 01:11:49.590
- You mean Glont?
- Yeah...


01:11:50.520 --> 01:11:53.592
He thought he'd hit the
jackpot, but...


01:11:53.760 --> 01:11:56.228
And now you wanna save him from
burning in hell?


01:11:57.200 --> 01:11:58.189
Kindda...


01:12:00.920 --> 01:12:06.233
And what would people say if I let
this guy get away unpunished?


01:12:06.360 --> 01:12:07.873
I'm not saying you should let him
get away with it.


01:12:08.040 --> 01:12:11.794
Just give him more time to raise
the money. It's a lot of money...


01:12:12.720 --> 01:12:19.273
His sins are plenty too:
he cheated, he lied, he stole...


01:12:21.600 --> 01:12:23.556
Your friend has got to pay me back!


01:12:24.600 --> 01:12:27.478
What if I gave you the money? I'm
going to my mother's in Spain, so...


01:12:27.600 --> 01:12:29.636
This isn't about money,
it's about principles!


01:12:29.760 --> 01:12:31.478
Romanians don't have principles
anymore!


01:12:32.720 --> 01:12:35.712
They're all a bunch of cattle,
of wiseass worms!


01:12:36.800 --> 01:12:39.872
They need someone who sees things
more clearly, don't you think?


01:12:40.840 --> 01:12:45.436
- Yeah, I mean, I'm not sure...
- You used to be smarter as a child!


01:12:47.360 --> 01:12:49.555
I'm sorry, I'm not sure
I understand what you mean...


01:12:52.640 --> 01:12:58.237
I mean the only way to redemption
goes through the flames of hell!


01:13:02.920 --> 01:13:04.114
Excuse me for a second.


01:13:07.880 --> 01:13:10.758
Yes. At a friend's place.


01:13:13.120 --> 01:13:15.634
I don't know, 10 minutes, 15 maybe,
why do you ask?


01:13:15.920 --> 01:13:17.911
Stelea Spataru 8...
Why, something happened?


01:13:18.080 --> 01:13:21.152
MK, bye... Could you please tell me
where the bathroom is?


01:13:21.480 --> 01:13:22.629
It's over there.


01:13:37.880 --> 01:13:40.678
Yes, she's in the bathroom.


01:13:41.080 --> 01:13:43.674
No, she doesn't know anything.


01:13:46.920 --> 01:13:48.478
I'll come up there.


01:13:55.440 --> 01:13:56.475
Cristina!


01:14:04.200 --> 01:14:05.838
- What's up?
- Where's Andreea?


01:14:06.560 --> 01:14:09.074
- I left her with Glont at the hotel.
- That's where I'm coming from!


01:14:10.880 --> 01:14:12.393
Let me call Glont.


01:14:14.880 --> 01:14:16.598
- Are you alright?
- Yes.


01:14:22.400 --> 01:14:23.753
He's rejecting my call.


01:14:24.640 --> 01:14:25.629
Keep trying.


01:14:31.280 --> 01:14:34.670
- Man, why is he rejecting my call?
- Shouldn't we call the police?


01:14:37.080 --> 01:14:38.035
Cristina!


01:14:41.360 --> 01:14:42.349
Johnny!


01:14:43.840 --> 01:14:44.909
I'll call you back!


01:14:47.520 --> 01:14:49.033
Hold on a second, Johnny.


01:14:49.600 --> 01:14:53.718
While I was at your place, I left
my girl at the hotel with Glont.


01:14:54.320 --> 01:14:56.519
- Yeah, so?
- They're and I can't reach Glont.


01:14:57.160 --> 01:15:00.789
I can't help you, Cris, I'm sorry.
I have a really important meeting.


01:15:00.920 --> 01:15:03.832
Fuck it, Johnny, please help me
find Andreea!


01:15:04.920 --> 01:15:06.638
Try to understand, Cris,
I really can't.


01:15:08.240 --> 01:15:09.992
All I can do for you is this.


01:15:15.920 --> 01:15:19.469
Dacos, there's something
I need you to do, man.


01:15:19.680 --> 01:15:22.990
There's this guy I asked you
to keep an eye on...


01:15:23.120 --> 01:15:24.951
- Glont.
- Glont, some guy named Glont.


01:15:25.120 --> 01:15:26.997
Yeah, the one with the stash.


01:15:27.120 --> 01:15:31.477
It looks like the guy
kidnapped Cris' baby.


01:15:33.600 --> 01:15:40.199
Yeah, great!
I'll let you talk to her. Here!


01:15:42.600 --> 01:15:46.115
Hey, I left them at the hotel
to come to see Johnny.


01:15:46.800 --> 01:15:50.634
What park? He was a fucking mess
after your visit.


01:15:56.160 --> 01:15:58.549
- Gotta get some flowers and then...
- So you won't help me!


01:15:58.680 --> 01:16:02.036
You haven't changed a bit!
Relax, you'll be alright!


01:16:02.400 --> 01:16:04.595
You, on the other hand, are
a completely different person!


01:16:09.440 --> 01:16:10.509
Are you free?


01:16:15.200 --> 01:16:17.270
Listen...


01:16:18.280 --> 01:16:19.759
Follow that BMW.


01:16:42.320 --> 01:16:45.596
- I beg of you, make that call now!
- We know what we have to do!


01:16:48.480 --> 01:16:54.191
Dispatch? Who's on patrol at Sfanta
Vineri? Gullit? Put him through.


01:16:57.760 --> 01:17:00.433
Simona, would you be so kind as to
give the lady a form to fill?


01:17:03.720 --> 01:17:08.840
Hello, Gullit? Yes, Mastacan here.
Don't you know my voice anymore?


01:17:08.960 --> 01:17:11.315
Mr are you too busy
doing something in the car?


01:17:11.720 --> 01:17:16.271
Listen, we got a kidnapped child!
Yes, we're still on for six, I told you...


01:17:16.400 --> 01:17:19.551
It involves junkies, man.
The guy's name is Glont.


01:17:52.560 --> 01:17:53.788
Wait for me here.


01:18:18.840 --> 01:18:20.432
Good evening, I'm with Johnny.


01:18:21.400 --> 01:18:23.868
I just been to the beauty parlor
and I'm a little late, you know...


01:18:25.840 --> 01:18:27.558
He came in before me.
I called him to wait for me...


01:18:27.680 --> 01:18:30.877
...but he was in another call.
You want me to call him again?


01:18:31.720 --> 01:18:33.631
- Have you been here before?
- Mf course!


01:18:33.800 --> 01:18:36.519
Then you know the way.


01:19:17.080 --> 01:19:21.073
We should ship them via Bulgaria,
then Greece...


01:19:21.520 --> 01:19:24.318
...then on to South of Italy by boat.


01:19:25.320 --> 01:19:27.709
We have our people,
why should we risk?


01:19:29.520 --> 01:19:32.876
- What about the papers?
- It's MK.


01:20:26.240 --> 01:20:31.234
You know those who get the organs
get the doners' craziness.


01:20:32.880 --> 01:20:35.189
Are you gonna join us, Violeta?
I thought you didn't like fish.


01:20:35.320 --> 01:20:38.915
You Romanians like pork...


01:20:40.400 --> 01:20:45.599
I brought an extra portion for the
young lady who's with Mr. Johnny.


01:20:47.600 --> 01:20:49.670
- Did you bring someone?
- No.


01:20:50.680 --> 01:20:52.432
There was a young lady who said
she's here with Mr. Johnny...


01:20:52.600 --> 01:20:54.636
...that she'd been to a beauty parlor,
what do I know?


01:20:55.800 --> 01:20:59.509
Wait a minute, I know what
this is about.


01:21:21.520 --> 01:21:24.318
- Is the security system on?
- Turned it off when Mr. Johnny came.


01:21:24.480 --> 01:21:25.959
- Turn it back on!
- Yes.


01:22:33.680 --> 01:22:39.630
Hi! I thought you were...
I couldn't.


01:22:42.000 --> 01:22:46.949
Please, don't get angry with me,
my love. Yes, I'm fine.


01:22:49.560 --> 01:22:52.836
I gotta go. I have another call
on the other phone. I love you.


01:22:54.240 --> 01:22:57.516
Hello! Yes, I'll be right down.


01:23:16.120 --> 01:23:17.633
- Hello.
- Good evening.


01:23:17.760 --> 01:23:19.796
- Meet Dr. Saizu.
- Hello.


01:23:20.400 --> 01:23:23.392
Can you show me some ID?
It's the procedure.


01:23:24.760 --> 01:23:25.829
Yes.

